# The scatter generator writes canonical UTF-8/LF bytes into a Generated directory beside the
# recipe that produced them, and tests compare the tracked fixtures against regenerated output
# byte for byte. This rule sits at the vegetation root so it covers every authored world, not only
# the showcase valley, and these artifacts must never be normalized by an end-of-line conversion.
*.arivegetationgenerated -text
*.arivegetationgenerated.meta -text